00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:56.970
What more valuable a sacrifice could you make

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.950
than to kill a buffalo and offer it to the sun?

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.910
You don't just go out and kill a buffalo.

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.680
You go to your ceremonies, you pray,

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:11.870
and you ask for the gift of a buffalo.

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:15.790
You ask that a buffalo will give itself to you,

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:18.700
and it's a spiritual relationship.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.660
You do everything in prayer,

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:25.790
and you do everything with a pure heart.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.330
- During the mass extinction

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:30.000
of prehistoric mammals, the horse

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.600
It was one of the species that had disappeared from North America.

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:41.550
For hundreds of generations after that, native people ventured onto the plains by foot, relying

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:45.590
on dogs to pull their belongings.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:50.560
Hunting buffalo was difficult and dangerous.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:54.270
To get close enough with a bow and arrow or a lance,

