00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:30.000
turned into bowstrings and the sharpened horn fragment into an arrowhead. Dried buffalo

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:37.670
made fuel for fires, an essential commodity on the nearly treeless plains.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:43.770
So nothing was wasted. Even the waste wasn't wasted. Everything was used except for the

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:49.400
grunting. And even then they were using some of the ceremonies, I'm sure, to imitate the

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:53.740
buffalo. So even the sounds were used.

00:20:53.740 --> 00:21:00.000
It gives itself to the people as a sacrifice. Here I am, you can make use of me, I can have

