00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:53.500
There is a time coming. Many things will change.

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:55.840
Strangers will appear among you.

00:22:55.840 --> 00:23:00.000
Their skins are light-colored and their ways are powerful.

00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:02.800
These people do not follow the way

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:03.940
of our great-grandfather.

00:23:04.780 --> 00:23:06.780
They follow another way.

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:18.920
1492, Christopher Columbus,

00:23:19.510 --> 00:23:21.270
